### ============================================
### NOTIFICATION HUB - API TEST SUITE
### ============================================

### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api
@userId = 1
@topicId = 1
@email = test@example.com
@password = password123

### ============================================
### AUTHENTICATION
### ============================================

### 1. Signup - Create new user
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{@email}}",
  "password": "{{@password}}"
}

### ============================================
### TOPICS
### ============================================

### 2. Create Topic
POST {{baseUrl}}/topics
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "sports"
}

### 3. List All Topics
GET {{baseUrl}}/topics

### ============================================
### SUBSCRIPTIONS
### ============================================

### 4. Subscribe User to Topic
POST {{baseUrl}}/subscriptions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": {{@userId}},
  "topicId": {{@topicId}}
}

### 5. Get User's Subscriptions
GET {{baseUrl}}/subscriptions/{{@userId}}

### ============================================
### PUBLISHING & REAL-TIME
### ============================================

### 6. Publish Message to Topic
POST {{baseUrl}}/publish
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "topicId": {{@topicId}},
  "content": "Hello everyone!",
  "createdBy": {{@userId}}
}

### 7. Connect to SSE Stream (Keep open)
GET {{baseUrl}}/events/{{@userId}}

### 8. Publish Message While SSE Connected
POST {{baseUrl}}/publish
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "topicId": {{@topicId}},
  "content": "Real-time test message!",
  "createdBy": {{@userId}}
}